        "note": "Kraus and von Raumer, \"A rewriting coherence theorem with applications in homotopy type theory\", Mathematical Structures in Computer Science 32(7) (2022), 982-1014, doi:10.1017/S0960129523000026, formalized in Agda. It proves an abstract coherence theorem (a terminating generalised 2-polygraph, closed under congruence and cancelling inverses, with a Winkler–Buchberger structure, has a homotopy basis), a relative of Squier's theorem for abstract rewriting. It has no critical pairs of string rewriting systems and no finite derivation type. No code is shared.",
        "relationship": "independent"
